{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmh7v4wjRZUrJtCxWTJc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I read five screens and stopped.\n\nWhat I'm telling my son:\n\n\"Listen, I'm not deciding anything alone. As far as I understood, the page says the cheapest way is an account at 'פסגות' with a fund called 'אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125'. Its number is 5112628 and it charges 'דמי ניהול 0.1%'. They write that after 10 years I'd be left with '86,045 ₪', and it's marked 'הזול'. The first bank on the list is 'לאומי' at '82,968 ₪'. I don't really know פסגות, it isn't my bank. I'm only fairly sure I read it right, so I'll ask you, or ask at the bank why theirs costs more.\"\n\nWhat I looked at, in order:\n1. **The top.** The heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\". English letters on buttons, MSCI and S&P, which I skipped. Then \"ת\"א-125\" already lit up, and boxes with numbers in them: 10,000, 500, 10 years, 7%.\n   - The first big number that stayed with me was \"70,000 ₪\", what I put in. Then \"86,045 ₪ הבחירה שלכם · הזול\".\n2. **Two lists.** One of funds on the left and one of companies and banks on the right. On the right: פסגות first, then לאומי, הבינלאומי, מסד, הפועלים, יהב, ירושלים, דיסקונט, אי.בי.אי., מזרחי טפחות, and lower down names I've never heard of, like אלטשולר טרייד and אקסלנס.\n   - My own bank is lower and leaves less, by a few thousand.\n3. **A chart with many coloured lines.** I didn't try to read it.\n\nWhat I didn't understand:\n- 'תשואה בשנה 7%': is that a promise or a guess? It's 7%, not a deposit rate.\n- In the funds list: 'מחקה', 'קרן סל', 'צוברת', 'דמי משמרת', 'מול המדד' and 'קבועים'.\n- 'דמי ניהול חשבון' and 'התעריפון'.\n- The red numbers with a minus, like '-1,030 ₪' and '-0.04%'. I don't know if that means losing money or something else. It scared me off those lines.\n- The coloured bars on each bank. The orange and red look almost the same to me.\n- The grey lines under